00:25:28.670 --> 00:25:28.670
THE TREATY FOR THE ONE PERCENT REALLOCATION OF MILITARY EXPENDITURES TOWARDS BIOMEDICAL RESEARCH AND DEVELOPMENT FOR THE

214
